flowchart TD
    Start((Start)) --> A[Citizen fills report details]
    A --> B{Attach Photo?}
    B -->|Yes| C[Upload Photo to Storage]
    C --> D[Get Image URL]
    D --> E[Submit Form]
    B -->|No| E
    
    E --> F[System inserts report into DB]
    F --> G[System triggers /api/reward-citizen]
    
    G --> H[Server validates request]
    H --> I[Server signs transaction with Treasury Wallet]
    I --> J[Blockchain processes Token Transfer]
    
    J --> K[Server receives Transaction Hash]
    K --> L[Server updates report with reward_tx]
    
    L --> M[Display Success & Token Alert to Citizen]
    M --> End((End))
